sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Player (Chrome / Firefox)
    participant A as React app<br/>My identities screen
    participant L as localStorage
    participant W as Cloudflare Worker<br/>gesellschaftmd.com/__/auth
    participant F as Firebase Auth
    participant D as Firestore<br/>users/{uid}
    P->>A: Open gesellschaftmd.com (HTTPS, Cloudflare)
    A->>L: Load saved data (works offline)
    P->>A: Sign in with Google
    A->>W: signInWithPopup (Google OAuth, same-site helper)
    W->>F: Passes /__/auth through to Firebase
    F-->>A: ID token + uid
    A->>D: onSnapshot(users/{uid})
    D-->>A: Cloud copy of saved data
    alt Cloud copy differs from this computer
        A-->>P: Side-by-side preview: keep this computer's or use the cloud copy
        P->>A: Choose one (Undo available)
    end
    P->>A: Tap identities to mark owned
    A->>L: Save identities.v1 immediately
    A->>D: setDoc(merge) data.identities_v1 (1 s debounce)
    alt Write accepted (rules: request.auth.uid == uid)
        D-->>A: OK
        A-->>P: "Synced"
    else Offline / write failed
        A-->>P: "Couldn't save. Retry" (kept in localStorage)
    end
